  "summary": "Amend the inherited gate: the attempt path timestamp is only checked against producer startedAt, so a pre-invocation attempt passes despite invocation-relative startedAt. Actual byte/source verification, producer field compatibility, module pinning, 11 validator tests, root Go suite, and the recorded proof go-run check passed.",
