      "id": "XR-FIX-INHERITED-GATE-01",
      "severity": "must-fix-invocation-freshness",
      "path": "compiled-children/inherited-acceptance.mjs:25-36,139-144",
      "description": "parseAttemptTime receives only receipt.attempt and receipt.startedAt. The validator separately requires startedAt >= invocationStartedAt, but does not require the timestamp embedded in attempt >= invocationStartedAt. A timestamped attempt can therefore predate the current invocation and still pass.",
